==Battleground==
*1 [[Golden Doge]] spawns as the boss after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*2 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

Note that this stage has an average Banknote drop of 125, meaning you have a 25% profit on average. This is by far the best stage out of all three to get Banknotes from, though you should be careful of the 60% chance to lose half your Banknotes. The first stage is much safer overall, but this is technically the most profitable stage out of all three.

[[Treasure Radar]] '''DOES NOT''' guarantee the 300 Banknote drop.

